# Force LF line endings for text files regardless of each developer's
# local git autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows checkouts get CRLF
# while Mac/Linux checkouts get LF -- the same committed content then
# fails `prettier --check` (which defaults to enforcing LF) on Windows
# machines even though nothing is actually different content-wise. This
# project is explicitly cross-platform (Docker setup tested on Windows
# and Mac per the project proposal), so normalizing to one line ending
# in the repository itself is the correct fix, not making tooling match
# one platform's default.
* text=auto eol=lf
